! SEED=221
! GAME=../entharion/zcode-infocom/sherlock-r26-s880127.z5

# The other sound release. Along this recording the game issues 18
# sound_effect calls in the full four-operand Version 5 form --
# number, effect, volume, AND an end-of-sound routine -- all
# passing in the conforming quiet (§9): Big Ben (17) on first
# arrival, the belfry bell (7) through the sapphire grabs, the
# girl's heartbeat (13) under the stethoscope, the armour (3)
# clanking every step through the Tower. The routine of a sound
# that never plays is never called, and this file proves it for a
# whole game. Sherlock also earned two engine settlements on the
# way: storeb keeps a large value's least significant byte, and
# out-of-range set_attr/clear_attr pass quietly (attribute 48, the
# bug Frotz pardons by name).

# The banner's [Press any key.] spends the bare > below; then the
# knock brings Mrs Hudson and the summons story.
